## Component Usage Rules

### 0. Existing Components First (HIGHEST PRIORITY)
**ALWAYS check existing components before creating anything new**

```tsx
// ✅ CORRECT: Check and use existing components
import { H1, H2, Subtitle } from '@/components/ui/headings'
import { ResendVerificationEmail } from '@/components/ui/resend-verification-email'
import { ThreeDotLoader } from '@/components/ui/loaders'
